Everything in sources/ is invented. QUORVANTA, soriximel tavorate, dimethyl
tavorate, Brennick syndrome, Arden Quay Biosciences, QuorvantaConnect and every
person, plan, pharmacy and organization named in the pack do not exist. The
licenses grant no right to use any of those names as a trademark, and the pack
contains no medical information.

